00:07:50.487 --> 00:07:54.519
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:08:01.336
<v Slow>仙台七夕まつりは、いつまで続きますか。

00:08:02.136 --> 00:08:03.983
<v Host>Until August eighth.

00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:11.975
<v Slow>アーケードの通りに、七夕の飾りが約何本ありますか。

00:08:12.776 --> 00:08:14.624
<v Host>About three thousand.

00:08:15.223 --> 00:08:27.271
<v Host>That's all for today. The Sendai Tanabata Festival runs until August eighth. If you ever walk under those three thousand paper streamers, you can make a wish of your own. See you next time!

00:08:27.872 --> 00:08:30.271
<v News>また明日。
